      "sourceDate": "碑文婚序记载，未载前婚年月",
      "title": "为刘崇俊前夫人",
      "summary": "徐铉《刘公神道碑》明确记刘崇俊前夫人李氏为太师赵忠懿王李德诚之女，并与后夫人分别叙列。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "quantangwen-v884",
          "paragraphId": "quantangwen-v884-p30",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "390e8bc7cdb4cda6192b3a8d4564460ffc6dba14ccba4e7061f05eeb91a7d755",
          "excerpt": "前夫人李氏，後夫人隴西郡君李氏，皆太師趙忠懿王女也。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "shiguochunqiu-v007",
          "paragraphId": "shiguochunqiu-v007-p12",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "fd9f0c86a430fd3390fa2e303c845a663ac1206bd19b099d02afcf245838ac6b",
          "excerpt": "南唐受禪，拜太師，封南平王，進封趙王。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "shiguochunqiu-v007",
          "paragraphId": "shiguochunqiu-v007-p12",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "fd9f0c86a430fd3390fa2e303c845a663ac1206bd19b099d02afcf245838ac6b",
          "excerpt": "南唐先主廢朝五日，諡曰忠懿。"
        }
      ],
      "phase": "uncertain",
      "precision": "undated",
      "sortOrder": 0,
      "notes": [
        "这是碑文明记的婚配经历，不补死亡、离异或具体婚期。",
        "前后婚序不作二女出生长幼，也不把碑中八子逐一归母。"
      ]
    }
  ]
